{
  "name": "CONOWAVE Referenz-Index stuendlicher Lauf",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "41 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Stuendlich zur Minute 41",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://conowave-reference-worker.conowave.workers.dev/run?force=1",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Referenz-Index anstossen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        20,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.body && $json.body.fehler && $json.body.fehler.length) || 0 }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Lauf fehlgeschlagen?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CONOWAVE Referenz-Index\n\nStuendlicher Anstoss des Workers\nconowave-reference-worker.\n\n**Nur Netz, kein Normalbetrieb.** Im\nNormalfall halten die drei\nShopify-Webhooks auf\nmetaobjects/* den Index aktuell.\nDieser Ablauf faengt nur den Fall\nab, dass ein Webhook verloren geht.\n\n**Temporaer.** Er ersetzt den\nCloudflare-Cron, weil das Konto auf\nWorkers Free die fuenf Cron-Trigger\nje Konto ausgeschoepft hat. Sobald\nWorkers Paid gebucht ist, wandert\nder Zeitplan zurueck in die\nwrangler.toml und dieser Ablauf\nkann abgeschaltet werden.\n\n**Zugang:** Header-Auth-Credential\nmit Name `Authorization` und Wert\n`Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>`. Der Token\nsteht in Cloudflare unter Settings,\nVariables and secrets.\n\nDer true-Zweig des IF ist bewusst\nleer. Dort gehoert eure uebliche\nBenachrichtigung hin.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 340
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Hinweise",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        -160
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Stuendlich zur Minute 41": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Referenz-Index anstossen",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Referenz-Index anstossen": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Lauf fehlgeschlagen?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}